  "summary": "The plan presents Mina’s work through six rearranging evidence cards following her own job-card sequence, with clear attribution and accessible fallbacks. Its greatest weakness is that finished narrative captions and the closing answer remain deferred, leaving the complete reading experience less reviewable than the visual choreography."
